<!doctype html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width">
    <meta name="title" content="Case Study">
    <meta name="description" content="Case Study">
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
    <meta name="language" content="English">
    <meta name="revisit-after" content="30 days">
<title>Old Chicago - Portfolio - Case Study - Tim (Timber) Hjellum</title>
<!-- Favicons -->
		<link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/images/favicon.ico" />
		<link
			rel="icon"
			type="image/png"
			sizes="16x16"
			href="/images/favicon-16x16.png"
		/>
		<link
			rel="icon"
			type="image/png"
			sizes="32x32"
			href="/images/favicon-32x32.png"
		/>
		<link
			rel="icon"
			type="image/png"
			sizes="96x96"
			href="/images/favicon-96x96.png"
		/>
		<link
			rel="apple-touch-icon"
			sizes="180x180"
			href="/images/apple-touch-icon.png"
		/>
		<link
			rel="icon"
			type="image/png"
			sizes="192x192"
			href="/images/android-chrome-192x192.png"
		/>
		<link
			rel="icon"
			type="image/png"
			sizes="512x512"
			href="/images/android-chrome-512x512.png"
		/>
		<link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Oswald:wght@500;600;700&family=Source+Serif+4:ital,opsz,wght@0,8..60,400;0,8..60,600;1,8..60,400&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  /* ---------- Tokens ---------- */
  :root{
    --bg: #E4E1D9;
    --surface: #FAF8F3;
    --surface-2: #EEEAE0;
    --text: #211D18;
    --text-muted: #6E665A;
    --accent: #B1531F;
    --accent-2: #C77A1E;
    --line: #CEC8BA;
    --shadow: 220 15% 10%;

    /* brand constants — same in both themes on purpose */
    --iron: #1C1915;
    --iron-2: #262119;
    --cream-on-iron: #EFE8D8;
    --muted-on-iron: #A79878;
    --ember: #E2932E;
    --ember-2: #F0B65A;
    --rivet: #8A7355;
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]){
      --bg: #17140F;
      --surface: #211C15;
      --surface-2: #2A241B;
      --text: #ECE6D8;
      --text-muted: #A89C89;
      --accent: #D97D3C;
      --accent-2: #E2932E;
      --line: #3A332A;
    }
  }
  :root[data-theme="dark"]{
    --bg: #17140F;
    --surface: #211C15;
    --surface-2: #2A241B;
    --text: #ECE6D8;
    --text-muted: #A89C89;
    --accent: #D97D3C;
    --accent-2: #E2932E;
    --line: #3A332A;
  }

  /* ---------- Base ---------- */
  *,*::before,*::after{ box-sizing: border-box; }
  html{ scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){ html{ scroll-behavior: auto; } }

  body{
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: "Source Serif 4", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  h1,h2,h3,.wordmark,.btn,.eyebrow,nav a,.stat-label,.card-title{
    font-family: "Oswald", "Arial Narrow", sans-serif;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  h2{
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 2.6vw, 2.35rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-wrap: balance;
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }
  h3{ font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 0.4rem; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }

  p{ margin: 0 0 1rem; max-width: 62ch; }
  a{ color: inherit; }

  .eyebrow{
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
  }

  section{ padding: 5.5rem 1.5rem; }
  .wrap{ max-width: 68rem; margin: 0 auto; }

  .section-head{ max-width: 46rem; margin-bottom: 2.75rem; }
  .section-head p{ color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 58ch; }

  /* ---------- Buttons (cut-corner, stamped-tag) ---------- */
  .btn{
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    clip-path: polygon(0 0, calc(100% - 14px) 0, 100% 14px, 100% 100%, 14px 100%, 0 calc(100% - 14px));
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .btn:focus-visible{ outline: 2px solid var(--ember); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .btn-accent{ background: var(--accent); color: #FBF6EC; }
  .btn-accent:hover{ background: var(--accent-2); transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .btn-ghost{ background: transparent; color: var(--cream-on-iron); border-color: rgba(239,232,216,0.35); }
  .btn-ghost:hover{ border-color: var(--ember); color: var(--ember-2); }

  /* ---------- Header ---------- */
  .site-header{
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 40;
    background: var(--iron);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(239,232,216,0.12);
  }
  .header-inner{
    max-width: 68rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0.9rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .wordmark{
    color: var(--cream-on-iron);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .wordmark span{ color: var(--ember); }
  .site-nav{
    display: flex; gap: 1.6rem; margin-left: 0.5rem; flex: 1;
  }
  .site-nav a{
    color: var(--muted-on-iron);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    white-space: nowrap;
    padding: 0.3rem 0;
    border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
  }
  .site-nav a:hover{ color: var(--cream-on-iron); border-color: var(--ember); }
  .header-cta{ white-space: nowrap; }
  .nav-toggle-input, .nav-toggle-label{ display: none; }

  @media (max-width: 780px){
    .site-nav{
      display: none;
      position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 100%;
      background: var(--iron); flex-direction: column; gap: 0;
      padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem 1rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(239,232,216,0.12);
    }
    .site-nav a{ padding: 0.7rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(239,232,216,0.08); }
    .nav-toggle-input:checked ~ .site-nav{ display: flex; }
    .header-inner{ position: relative; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .nav-toggle-label{
      display: inline-flex; margin-left: auto; color: var(--cream-on-iron);
      font-size: 1.4rem; cursor: pointer; line-height: 1;
    }
    .header-cta{ order: 3; margin-left: auto; }
  }

  /* ---------- Hero (always iron/ember, deliberate constant) ---------- */
  .hero{
    position: relative;
    background: var(--iron);
    color: var(--cream-on-iron);
    padding: 6.5rem 1.5rem 5.5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    isolation: isolate;
  }
  .hero::before{
    content: "";
    position: absolute; inset: -20%;
    background: radial-gradient(45% 55% at 78% 30%, rgba(226,147,46,0.35), transparent 70%),
                radial-gradient(30% 40% at 15% 85%, rgba(226,147,46,0.14), transparent 70%);
    z-index: -1;
    animation: glow 9s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){ .hero::before{ animation: none; } }
  @keyframes glow{
    0%, 100% { opacity: 0.85; }
    50% { opacity: 1.15; }
  }
  .hero-inner{ max-width: 68rem; margin: 0 auto; }
  .hero .eyebrow{ color: var(--ember-2); }
  .hero h1{
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    line-height: 1.04;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
    max-width: 18ch;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .hero-sub{
    font-family: "Source Serif 4", Georgia, serif;
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: normal;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--muted-on-iron);
    max-width: 52ch;
  }
  .hero-actions{ display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.8rem; }

  /* ---------- Cards w/ rivet corners ---------- */
  .card{
    position: relative;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 1.6rem 1.5rem;
  }
  .card::before, .card::after{
    content: "";
    position: absolute; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--rivet); opacity: 0.55;
  }
  .card::before{ top: 9px; left: 9px; }
  .card::after{ bottom: 9px; right: 9px; }
  .card p{ color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.98rem; margin-bottom: 0; }

  /* ---------- On Tap ---------- */
  .tap-table-wrap{ overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  table.tap-table{
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    min-width: 560px;
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  .tap-table caption{ text-align: left; padding: 1rem 1.1rem 0; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .tap-table th, .tap-table td{
    text-align: left;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .tap-table thead th{
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 600;
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }
  .tap-table tbody tr:last-child td{ border-bottom: none; }
  .beer-name{ font-weight: 600; }
  .beer-style{ color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.88rem; }
  .num{ font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }

  /* ---------- Grids ---------- */
  .grid-2{ display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1.1rem; }
  .grid-4{ display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1.1rem; }
  @media (max-width: 900px){ .grid-4{ grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 560px){ .grid-2, .grid-4{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .stat{ font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace; font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); }
  .stat-label{ font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-muted); letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-top: 0.2rem; }

  /* ---------- Alternate section shading ---------- */
  .section-alt{ background: var(--surface-2); }

  /* ---------- Milestone table ---------- */
  .milestone-wrap{ overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  table.milestones{ width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; min-width: 520px; background: var(--surface); }
  .milestones th, .milestones td{ padding: 0.8rem 1.1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 0.94rem; text-align: left; }
  .milestones thead th{
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace; font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); background: var(--surface-2); font-weight: 600;
  }
  .milestones tbody tr:last-child td{ border-bottom: none; }
  .milestones .num{ font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); }

  /* ---------- Steps (genuine sequence) ---------- */
  .steps{ display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1.4rem; margin: 2rem 0; counter-reset: step; }
  @media (max-width: 780px){ .steps{ grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 480px){ .steps{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .step{ position: relative; padding-left: 0; }
  .step-num{
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--accent); border: 1px solid var(--accent); width: 1.9rem; height: 1.9rem;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
  }
  .step p{ font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

  .fine-print{ font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 2rem; max-width: 70ch; }

  /* ---------- Locations ---------- */
  .loc-card h3{ margin-bottom: 0.1rem; }
  .loc-card .loc-sub{ color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
  .loc-card .loc-line{ font-size: 0.92rem; margin-bottom: 0.15rem; }
  .loc-card .loc-line strong{ font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }

  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */
  footer{ background: var(--iron); color: var(--muted-on-iron); padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem 2.5rem; }
  .footer-inner{ max-width: 68rem; margin: 0 auto; }
  .footer-grid{ display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; padding-bottom: 2.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(239,232,216,0.12); }
  @media (max-width: 700px){ .footer-grid{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.6rem; } }
  .footer-grid .wordmark{ display: block; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
  .footer-grid p{ color: var(--muted-on-iron); font-size: 0.9rem; max-width: 32ch; }
  .footer-col h4{
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace; font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--cream-on-iron); margin: 0 0 0.9rem; font-weight: 600;
  }
  .footer-col a{ display: block; color: var(--muted-on-iron); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
  .footer-col a:hover{ color: var(--ember-2); }
  .footer-bottom{ padding-top: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--muted-on-iron); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; }

  ::selection{ background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="site-header">
  <div class="header-inner">
    <a class="wordmark" href="#hero">Old <span>Chicago</span></a>
    <input type="checkbox" id="nav-toggle" class="nav-toggle-input">
    <label for="nav-toggle" class="nav-toggle-label" aria-hidden="true">&#9776;</label>
    <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="#on-tap">Old Chicago Tap</a>
      <a href="#kitchen">Kitchen</a>
      <a href="#old-chicago-club">Old Chicago Club</a>
      <a href="#batch-tour">Batch Tour</a>
      <a href="#locations">Locations</a>
    </nav>
    <a class="btn btn-accent header-cta" href="#old-chicago-club">Join Old Chicago Club</a>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="hero" class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Pittsburgh &middot; Cleveland &middot; Bethlehem &middot; Birmingham</p>
    <h1>Fire made this town.<br>Now it makes our beer.</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Twelve house beers, brewed the way steel was once forged — under real heat, with real patience. A scratch kitchen, a tap list that turns with the seasons, and a rewards program built for people who come back.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#on-tap" class="btn btn-accent">See What's On Tap</a>
      <a href="#old-chicago-club" class="btn btn-ghost">Join Old Chicago Club — It's Free</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="on-tap">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">The Core Twelve</p>
      <h2>House Beers, Kept On Tap Year-Round</h2>
      <p>Every batch is brewed on-site in our 15-barrel system and named for the trade that built this town. No guest taps in the core lineup — if it's on this list, we made it downstairs.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tap-table-wrap">
      <table class="tap-table">
        <caption>Style, ABV, and IBU for all twelve house beers.</caption>
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Beer</th><th>Style</th><th>ABV</th><th>IBU</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><div class="beer-name">Rivet IPA</div></td><td class="beer-style">West Coast IPA</td><td class="num">6.8%</td><td class="num">65</td></tr>
          <tr><td><div class="beer-name">Anvil Amber</div></td><td class="beer-style">American Amber Ale</td><td class="num">5.4%</td><td class="num">28</td></tr>
          <tr><td><div class="beer-name">Slag Heap Stout</div></td><td class="beer-style">Oatmeal Stout</td><td class="num">5.9%</td><td class="num">34</td></tr>
          <tr><td><div class="beer-name">Quench K&ouml;lsch</div></td><td class="beer-style">K&ouml;lsch-Style Ale</td><td class="num">4.8%</td><td class="num">19</td></tr>
          <tr><td><div class="beer-name">Cinder Block Porter</div></td><td class="beer-style">Robust Porter</td><td class="num">6.1%</td><td class="num">30</td></tr>
          <tr><td><div class="beer-name">Molten M&auml;rzen</div></td><td class="beer-style">Oktoberfest M&auml;rzen</td><td class="num">5.6%</td><td class="num">22</td></tr>
          <tr><td><div class="beer-name">Tempered Wheat</div></td><td class="beer-style">American Wheat</td><td class="num">4.9%</td><td class="num">14</td></tr>
          <tr><td><div class="beer-name">Foundry Pils</div></td><td class="beer-style">German-Style Pilsner</td><td class="num">5.0%</td><td class="num">32</td></tr>
          <tr><td><div class="beer-name">Hammered Hefe</div></td><td class="beer-style">Bavarian Hefeweizen</td><td class="num">5.2%</td><td class="num">12</td></tr>
          <tr><td><div class="beer-name">Ironclad Imperial Stout</div></td><td class="beer-style">Imperial Stout</td><td class="num">9.4%</td><td class="num">55</td></tr>
          <tr><td><div class="beer-name">Smelter's Saison</div></td><td class="beer-style">Farmhouse Saison</td><td class="num">6.3%</td><td class="num">24</td></tr>
          <tr><td><div class="beer-name">Blast Furnace Barleywine</div></td><td class="beer-style">English Barleywine</td><td class="num">10.8%</td><td class="num">48</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="kitchen" class="section-alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Scratch Kitchen</p>
      <h2>Cooked to Order, Battered in Beer</h2>
      <p>Nothing arrives frozen. Our kitchen runs off the same house beers as the taps — cheese sauces reduced with Foundry Pils, glazes built on Anvil Amber, batters that would fall apart without a good pilsner behind them.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Soft Pretzel Stack</h3>
        <p>Bavarian-style pretzels, torn to share, with a Foundry Pils beer cheese still bubbling from the broiler.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Wood-Fired Flatbread</h3>
        <p>Smoked brisket, pickled red onion, and an Anvil Amber glaze on a flatbread fired in the open oven behind the bar.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Slag Heap Chili</h3>
        <p>A three-bean chili simmered for six hours with Slag Heap Stout, topped with cheddar and scallion.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Beer-Battered Fish &amp; Chips</h3>
        <p>Cod battered in Foundry Pils and fried to order, served with hand-cut fries and house tartar.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="old-chicago-club">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Loyalty, Not Punch Cards</p>
      <h2>Join Old Chicago Club</h2>
      <p>Free to join, and rewarding from the first visit. Every dollar earns Rivets — our house currency — and Rivets turn into food, gear, and first access to small-batch releases before anyone else sees them.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-4" style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="stat">$9</div>
        <div class="stat-label">FREE PRETZEL &amp; BEER CHEESE, FIRST VISIT</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="stat">1:1</div>
        <div class="stat-label">RIVET PER DOLLAR SPENT</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="stat">1</div>
        <div class="stat-label">FREE FLIGHT, YOUR BIRTHDAY MONTH</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="stat">100</div>
        <div class="stat-label">RIVETS = $5 OFF YOUR TAB</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 style="text-transform:none; font-family:'Source Serif 4', serif; font-size:1.05rem; letter-spacing:normal; font-weight:600;">Batch Tour milestone gear</h3>
    <p style="color:var(--text-muted); margin-bottom:0;">Log unique beers toward your Batch Tour (see below) and pick up house gear along the way — free the first time through, discounted Rivets after that.</p>
    <div class="milestone-wrap">
      <table class="milestones">
        <thead><tr><th>Batches Logged</th><th>First Tour</th><th>After First Tour</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td class="num">5</td><td>Old Chicago Club coaster set</td><td class="num">10 Rivets</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="num">10</td><td>Old bottle opener</td><td class="num">10 Rivets</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="num">15</td><td>Cast-iron pint glass</td><td class="num">15 Rivets</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="num">20</td><td>Old Chicago Club growler</td><td class="num">20 Rivets</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="num">25</td><td>Waxed canvas apron</td><td class="num">20 Rivets</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="num">30</td><td>Founders Wall nameplate + free growler fill</td><td class="num">40 Rivets</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="batch-tour" class="section-alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">The Long Haul</p>
      <h2>The Batch Tour</h2>
      <p>Thirty beers, logged one visit at a time — the Core Twelve plus our rotating seasonal batches. Finish it and your name goes on the Founders Wall in the taproom where you completed it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">1</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;">Pick up a card</h3>
        <p>Ask your server for a Batch Tour card, or start logging beers in the app once you've joined Forge Club.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">2</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;">Log as you go</h3>
        <p>Up to two beers count per visit. We track what you've had so you don't have to remember.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">3</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;">Hit your milestones</h3>
        <p>Gear unlocks automatically at 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, and 30 batches logged.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">4</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;">Get your nameplate</h3>
        <p>Finish all 30 and we stamp a nameplate for the Founders Wall at your home taproom.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="fine-print">State and local alcohol laws may limit how rewards are issued or redeemed. In visit-based states, batches are limited to two logged per visit, one visit per day. Beer selection, ABV, and IBU vary slightly by batch and location.</p>
  </div>
</section>

